bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition'&gt;标准普尔就预算和欧元雄心上调匈牙利信贷前景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hungary Credit Outlook Lifted by S&amp;P on Budget and Euro Ambition&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:19:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[华尔街日报] 标准普尔将法国信用评级展望从稳定调整为负面</title><link>https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/s-p-revises-outlook-on-french-credit-rating-to-negative-from-stable-eab7384f?mod=rss_worldnews</link><description>由于不断增加的公共债务和政治不确定性威胁到该国的财政，这一决定为评级下调铺平了道路。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[华尔街日报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/s-p-revises-outlook-on-french-credit-rating-to-negative-from-stable-eab7384f?mod=rss_worldnews'&gt;标准普尔将法国信用评级展望从稳定调整为负面&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P Revises Outlook on French Credit Rating to Negative From Stable&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/s-p-revises-outlook-on-french-credit-rating-to-negative-from-stable-eab7384f?mod=rss_worldnews</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 为超级富裕家庭管理 300B 美元：霍莉·麦克唐纳 (Holly MacDonald) 的商业硕士</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video</link><description>巴里与贝西默信托公司首席执行官霍莉·麦克唐纳进行了交谈。他们讨论了她在巴西的工作经历，以及投资新兴市场如何塑造她的投资理念。他们还讨论了美元的持久强势，以及 Bessemer 如何从单一家族办公室发展成为一家价值 3000 亿美元的企业。他们还讨论了如何构建世代财富和缓和家庭冲突。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video'&gt;为超级富裕家庭管理 300B 美元：霍莉·麦克唐纳 (Holly MacDonald) 的商业硕士&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Managing $300B for Ultra Wealthy Families: Masters in Business with Holly MacDonald&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:14:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 被监禁的巴西沙滩足球明星卷入俄美间谍纠纷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-into-russia-us-spy-dispute</link><description>一名巴西沙滩足球明星在莫斯科和华盛顿都在通缉的一名涉嫌俄罗斯间谍的争端中成为了一个不太可能的讨价还价筹码。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-into-russia-us-spy-dispute'&gt;被监禁的巴西沙滩足球明星卷入俄美间谍纠纷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jailed Brazil Beach Soccer Star Drawn Into Russia-US Spy Dispute&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-into-russia-us-spy-dispute</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:29:56 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>